---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import OfferCards from '../components/OfferCards.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/brett-portrait.jpg';
---
<Base title="Meet Brett" description="Brett Lyle's story: from a decade in EMS and healthcare strategy to helping professionals find career success.">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap story">
      <div class="arch photo">
        <Image src={portrait} alt="Brett Lyle seated on stone steps, smiling, in a sea-glass green blouse" widths={[380, 600]} sizes="380px" loading="eager" />
      </div>
      <article>
        <p class="eyebrow">Brett’s story</p>
        <h1>The why.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          I am an adventurous soul, always learning and growing. I love music, architecture, photography, food, and
          writing. I am passionate about cultures, people, and the art of communication.
        </p>
        <p>
          My personal goal is simple: to live a life that brings joy and purpose. I find my fulfillment in using my
          experiences to help others determine, create, and live passionately.
        </p>
        <p class="mantra">Design your life. Be intentional and accountable. Find true success and fulfillment. Reflect. Re-evaluate. Repeat.</p>

        <h2>It wasn’t always easy.</h2>
        <p>
          I’ve been fueled by mental resilience, emotional intelligence, self-awareness, and reflection. I have never
          been one to accept “because I said so” or “this is how we’ve always done it.”
        </p>
        <p>
          Understanding history matters, but it need not define your next chapter. Our experiences shape who we are,
          and who we become.
        </p>
        <div class="letter">
          <p>
            You can be whoever you want to be. You can do anything you put your mind to. You have that special thing
            inside of you that will get you there… and I’m going to help you find it.
          </p>
          <p class="script sign">Sincerely, Brett</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Uncover your professional success</p>
        <h2>Ways to get started</h2>
      </div>
      <OfferCards />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.7fr 1.3fr; gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px); align-items: start; }
  @media (max-width: 880px) { .story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .photo { max-width: 380px; position: sticky; top: 100px; }
  @media (max-width: 880px) { .photo { position: static; margin: 0 auto; } }
  h1 { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  h2 { margin: 2.6rem 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); }
  .lead { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  article p:not(.lead):not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); }
  .mantra { border-left: 3px solid var(--mint); padding-left: 1rem; font-style: italic; }
  .letter { margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem; background: var(--band); border-radius: 10px; }
  .letter p { color: var(--ink) !important; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .sign { font-size: 1.9rem; margin: 0.4rem 0 0; color: var(--mint-ink) !important; }
</style>
